sliding window is a optimized technique o solve problems involving subarrays or substrings it reduces
time complexity 
  Working of the sliding window:
    1]Create a window of a given size.
    2]Process the elements inside the window.
    3]Move (slide) the window by one position.
    4]Remove the outgoing element and add the incoming element.
    5]Repeat until the end of the array/string.


    
